{"id": "EUVD-2026-72874", "enisaUuid": "b65db32f-0012-372d-9418-1d7eaf3004cd", "description": "Snipe-IT versions before 8.7.0 contain a CSS injection vulnerability in the Custom CSS field due to incomplete sanitization that reverses HTML encoding on greater-than and double-quote characters. Superusers can plant malicious CSS payloads using @import and url() references to exfiltrate CSRF tokens from other superusers via attribute-selector rules, enabling account takeover.", "datePublished": "2026-09-08T15:14:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-08T15:30:34", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:H/SI:H/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/grokability/snipe-it/security/advisories/GHSA-pvcw-mp8q-mj39", "https://github.com/grokability/snipe-it/commit/d26d71688359707f3b257fc04fe6c3e5a17405f9", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/snipe-it-before-8.7.0-css-injection-via-custom-css"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-86738", "GHSA-hxfh-ccwg-qrc6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.49, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "bb4dee52-9744-3a14-9ac1-62508673c782", "product": {"name": "snipe-it", "vendor": {"name": "Grokability, Inc."}}, "product_version": "0 <8.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "2592524d-c7b6-3dc1-b7c0-1ee69d8c4940", "vendor": {"name": "grokability"}}], "isExploited": false}